    "why": "One core, two surface dialects. The deck dialect comes from the Aug 19 2026 brand guide; the screen dialect is the landing page rebuilt Sep 1 2026 for that same refresh, so it is newer and wins on screen. Colour, type families, logo, flatness of intent and copy rules are shared.",
