  "rulings_2026_09_09": [
    "Grey and muted text have one value per dialect, not one global value.",
    "Space Grotesk as display type is website-only (hero and closing CTA).",
    "Space Grotesk tracking is +1px everywhere; the R2 template's .14em is drift.",
    "A chip on graphite: fill accent/cyan with graphite ink, or a bare label in muted cyan. Pick one per product.",
    "The one-highlight rule counts elements, not coloured objects: a cyan diagram is one highlight."
  ],
